>Notice `src/firebase.js` is in the ignore list — it contains your Firebase config keys. Each developer should create it locally. More on this below.

---

### What NOT to upload
```
node_modules/       ← never, it's huge (100k+ files)
dist/               ← build output, not source
.env                ← secrets
src/firebase.js     ← Firebase credentials
